  restartButton: {fileID: 1942326752}
  quitButton: {fileID: 981840198}
  creditsText: "<size=130%><color=#7A2C10><b>Credits</b></color></size>\nNight Watch,
    INTE 42312 Virtual and Augmented Reality group project.\n\n<color=#7A2C10><b>3D
    models, CC BY 4.0</b></color>\nElephant: \"Low poly Realistic Elephant 3d model
    free\" by iRahulRajput (Sketchfab). Rigged and animated for this project.\nElectric
    fence: \"Wire Fence\" by Pixel-bit (Sketchfab).\nShed: \"Worn Shed PBR Game-Ready\"
    by donnichols (Sketchfab).\n\n<color=#7A2C10><b>Free assets, CC0</b></color>\nVillage
    models and textures: Poly Haven (Amal Kumar, Rob Tuytel, Rico Cilliers, Greg
    Zaal, Charlotte Baglioni, Dario Barresi, Dimitrios Savva, Aron \u0141yczek, Jenelle
    van Heerden, Kless Gyzen, Sebastian Platen, Kuutti Siitonen, James Ray Cock,
    Miroslav Turura, eye-candy.xyz).\nNeighbour, cow and bull: Quaternius.\nSky:
    Cloudy Skyboxes by Screaming Brain Studios.\n\n<color=#7A2C10><b>Font</b></color>\nCinzel
    by The Cinzel Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1.\n\nBuilt with Unity,
    XR Interaction Toolkit, OpenXR and AI Navigation. Sounds made in code by the
    team.\nFull list with links: CREDITS.md"
